     1,
     "Wild guess: try str(knp). Is elevation a factor or numeric? If the latter, convert it to factor and try again. If that doesn&#39;t work, I&#39;d suggest re-posting your question here with a reproducible example - i.e., a small data set with code that reproduces the problem along with a statement of what you expect. <div>\r\n<br></div><div>Dennis<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Nov 12, 2012 at 9:54 PM, Andy Boyce <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">andyj...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373921404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vxYlXNr6TXMrm07EBkP8p\">Given the code below, I&#39;m getting this very strange graphical output. No idea why, other than I brought this code in from a previous version of ggplot2 (and an older version of R). I have no idea where the ribbons are coming from, or why the typical crossbars have gone. Tried the same thing with geom_linerange and geom_errorbar with no problems. Help?!<br>\r\n</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373921404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vxYlXNr6TXMrm07EBkP8p\">knp_plot &lt;- ggplot(knp, aes(x=Elevation, y=KNP_MEANS, ymin=KNP_MINS, ymax=KNP_MAXS))<br>\r\n   knp_plot + geom_crossbar()</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373921404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vxYlXNr6TXMrm07EBkP8p\"></a></p>\r\n<br><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s1600/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373921404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vxYlXNr6TXMrm07EBkP8p\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-X0HdmkaH2F0/UKHf0J_gYxI/AAAAAAAAAAM/fNwDMQHIcOA/s320/geom_crossbar_error.jpeg\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" width=\"320\"></a></p>\r\n<span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373921404000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0nf6AWw8lyPVq_u16YK5u0\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href dat